► Counterfactual Validity (CV)   [τ = 0.8]
    Xn → Xp : 0.9450
    Xp → Xn : 0.6100
    mean     : 0.7775

► FID score  (lower = more realistic CFs)
  vs SOURCE class — ambiguous: high can mean real class change OR artifact
    FID(Xn,  Xc_n→p) : 105.77
    FID(Xp,  Xc_p→n) : 52.01
  vs TARGET class — the realism test, LOWER IS BETTER
    FID(Xp,  Xc_n→p) : 22.68
    FID(Xn,  Xc_p→n) : 4.38
    (high on BOTH rows = off-manifold edit, not a class change)

► Edit concentration  [model-free; top-5% of pixels' share of |Δ|]
    Xn → Xp : 0.255  (uniform baseline 0.05) | MAE=0.0302 | changed=64.7%
    Xp → Xn : 0.310  (uniform baseline 0.05) | MAE=0.0348 | changed=63.2%
    >~0.5 = focal edit. Near the baseline = diffuse, i.e. adversarial-shaped.

► Lesion Hit Rate (LHR)  [Xp → Xn, vs radiologist boxes — GROUND TRUTH]
    edit mass inside lesion : 0.393 ± 0.197
    chance baseline (area)  : 0.174 ± 0.111
    LIFT                    : 2.52×  [t=24.05, p=8.15e-53, n=148]
    1.0 = the edit ignores the annotation (adversarial-shaped). >1 = it targets the lesion.
    Xn → Xp : N/A by construction — negative sources have no annotation.

► Identity Preservation (IP)  [model-free FOP replacement, higher = better]
    Xn → Xp : MS-SSIM=0.9233  HF-corr=0.9484
    Xp → Xn : MS-SSIM=0.8749  HF-corr=0.9137

► CTR — Cardiomegaly clinical metric
    mean CTR(Xn)     = 0.4211 ± 0.0527
    mean CTR(Xp)     = 0.4396 ± 0.1059
    mean CTR(Xc_n→p) = 0.4084 ± 0.0595
    mean CTR(Xc_p→n) = 0.4406 ± 0.1181
    Δ CTR(Xn − Xc_n→p) = 0.0128 ± 0.0478  [t=3.77, p=0.0002]
    Δ CTR(Xp − Xc_p→n) = 0.0036 ± 0.1105  [t=0.43, p=0.6657]

► SCP — Pleural Effusion clinical metric
    ⚠ DEGENERATE — relative spread 0.19% across all four groups (< 2%).
    The sigmoid(-‖yolo_feat‖/50) proxy is saturated, so SCP is effectively a constant
    (0.4795 ± 0.0008) and its paired t-tests are testing numerical noise.
    Group means are retained in eval_metrics.json; the deltas and t-tests are withheld
    from it (see _strip_unreportable). Fix the proxy (a real CP-recess detector) or drop SCP.
